      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GETTING CHEEKY (8) has a strong overall record having five wins and 13 places from 24 starts but was out of the money last time when fifth (20.53) over 342m at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Drawn wide but with a clean break will be tough to beat again. RUSSO (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (20.29) at this track in a Other. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the rails draw. Well placed here and should do much better. KOTA LAMBAI (2) was below best last time finishing fourth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Other win two back at this track. Speedy runner and should be in the action early from an inside box. Has the ability and can find best this time. ASTON BAKER (7) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
